+                            <tr>
+                                <th>Tor</th>
+                                <td>
+                                    {% if onion.available %}
+                                        <span class="friglet_value">https://{{onion.host}}</span>
+                                    {% else %}
+                                        <span class="friglet_muted">{{onion.reason}}</span>
+                                    {% endif %}
+                                </td>
+                            </tr>
+                            <tr>
+                                <th>Password</th>
+                                <td>
+                                    {% if friglet_password %}
+                                        <span id="friglet_password" class="friglet_value" style="display: none; margin: 0;">{{friglet_password}}</span>
+                                        <span id="copy_friglet_password" class="ui-icon ui-icon-copy friglet_copy" data-target="friglet_password" style="cursor: pointer; display: none;" title="Copy password"></span>
+                                        <a id="show_friglet_password" class="ui-button ui-widget ui-corner-all mynode_button_small" style="width: 100px;">show password</a>
+                                    {% else %}
+                                        <span class="friglet_muted">Created when Friglet first starts</span>
+                                    {% endif %}
+                                </td>
+                            </tr>
+                        </table>
+                        <p>Your browser warns about the certificate the first time: MyNode signs it itself. Set up your wallet in the web interface by pasting the Silent Payments descriptor Sparrow shows and the wallet's birthday height.</p>
+                    </div>
+
+                    <div class="app_page_block_contents_heading">
+                        <div class="info-page-block">Connect Sparrow</div>
+                    </div>
+                    <div class="app_page_block_contents_text">
+                        <p>Use a separate Sparrow instance with its own data directory for this wallet. The server set in Sparrow applies to every wallet in that instance, and Friglet only knows this one: your other wallets would show no history. Switch the other instance back to your usual server to see them again.</p>
+                        <table class="info_table" style="font-size: 12px; margin-left: 10px">
+                            <tr>
+                                <th>Local network (recommended)</th>
+                                <td>
+                                    <span id="friglet_electrum_tls" class="friglet_value">{{electrum_tls}}</span>
+                                    <span class="ui-icon ui-icon-copy friglet_copy" data-target="friglet_electrum_tls" style="cursor: pointer;" title="Copy"></span>
+                                    <br/><span class="friglet_muted">Host {{local_ip}}, port {{electrum_tls_port}}, SSL on. The certificate is Friglet's own; compare its fingerprint with the one on Friglet's Connect page.</span>
+                                </td>
+                            </tr>
+                            <tr>
+                                <th>Tor</th>
+                                <td>
+                                    {% if onion.available %}
+                                        <span id="friglet_electrum_onion" class="friglet_value">{{onion.host}}:{{electrum_tcp_port}}:t</span>
+                                        <span class="ui-icon ui-icon-copy friglet_copy" data-target="friglet_electrum_onion" style="cursor: pointer;" title="Copy"></span>
+                                        <br/><span class="friglet_muted">Port {{electrum_tcp_port}}, SSL off (Tor encrypts the connection). Sparrow needs Tor running.</span>
+                                    {% else %}
+                                        <span class="friglet_muted">{{onion.reason}}</span>
+                                    {% endif %}
+                                </td>
+                            </tr>
+                        </table>
+                    </div>
+
+                    <div class="app_page_block_contents_heading">
+                        <div class="info-page-block">Privacy</div>
+                    </div>
+                    <div class="app_page_block_contents_text">
+                        <p>Anyone who can reach port {{electrum_tls_port}} on your local network, or who knows the onion address, can read this wallet's addresses, transactions and balance. Do not forward these ports on your router.</p>
+                        <p>Friglet gets tweak data from the BlindBit oracle (oracle.setor.dev), a third-party service run by BlindBit. The operator sees this node's IP address, which block ranges are scanned and when. It never sees your keys.</p>
+                        <p>Uninstalling Friglet deletes /mnt/hdd/mynode/blindbit-friglet: the scan key, the wallet settings, the scan progress and the login password. Your bitcoin is not affected.</p>
+                    </div>
+                    {% endif %}
